ate</text><text for="L5">That style and manner is ridiculous, right?</text><text for="L7">I&apos;m so lazy, that&apos;s probably the case</text><text for="L8">Just someone arranging a fine sound</text><text for="L11">In this world, in this head of mine</text><text for="L12">What a beautiful petal that falls</text><text for="L13">Balalaika I want to quench my thirst</text><text for="L16">Generally speaking, everyone&apos;s C,R,A,Z,Y</text><text for="L18">So let this fleeting emotion</text><text for="L21">My heart is beating 95, like a mad samurai</text><text for="L23">I&apos;m so ready to die that it&apos;s like it&apos;s attracting my bloodshot gaze</text><text for="L24">Say hello as the sun rises</text><text for="L25">On your sky, that pitch black sky</text><text for="L26">I&apos;ll rip it apart with my bare hands</text><text for="L27">You see, in that place</text><text for="L28">There&apos;s the trick of an audible heartbeat</text><text for="L29">What roars out is my own tune</text><text for="L30">My own tune - not someone else&apos;s</text><text for="L32">The world is blue, it stretches out before your eyes</text><text for="L33">But for now</text><text for="L34">Let&apos;s move move</text><text for="L35">There&apos;s no need to speak about our way of living</text><text for="L36">What&apos;s got you, exhilarated, so smug?</text><text for="L37">Give me more love</text><text for="L38">Don&apos;t say that you don&apos;t even know left from right</text><text for="L40">Your sneering shadow cackles</text><text for="L42">Generally speaking, the world is</text><text for="L46">So as if doing it over and over</text><text for="L47">ride on, ride on, ride on, ride on</text><text for="L49">I don&apos;t even understand it</text><text for="L51">I authorize this and that</text><text for="L53">Tell me something for the news, the bible for an era of great expectation</text><text for="L56">Save it for your big moment</text><text for="L60">Generally speaking, everyone&apos;s C,R,A,Z,Y</text><text for="L62">So let this fleeting emotion</text><text for="L63">Ride on, ride on, ride on, ride on</text><text for="L65">My heart is beating 95, like a mad samurai</text><text for="L67">I&apos;m so ready to die that it&apos;s like it&apos;s attracting my bloodshot gaze</text><text for="L68">Say hello as the sun rises</text><text for="L69">On your sky, that pitch black sky</text><text for="L70">I&apos;ll rip it apart with my bare hands</text><text for="L71">You see, in that place</text><text for="L72">There&apos;s the trick of an audible heartbeat</text><text for="L73">More surprises are yet to come</text><text for="L74">Yet to come</text><text for="L75">Ah, I&apos;m sick of waiting around</text><text for="L76">The clock hand ushers the midnight city</text><text for="L77">Come on, fiercely raise your voice</text><text for="L78">Hey, it&apos;s almost time</text><text for="L79">So let&apos;s begin this solitary feast</text><text for="L80">The song I play is my own tune:</text><text for="L81">My one of a kind tune</text></translation><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L3">挣脱吧 挣脱吧 每个细胞都是</text><text for="L4">我不需要 不情愿地哀叹现状</text><text for="L5">这副姿态模样 很可笑对吧？</text><text for="L6">难道你不觉得？</text><text for="L7">我懒到了家 大概就这样</text><text for="L8">美妙音符 不过是他人的排列</text><text for="L9">丢弃 粉碎 通通扔掉</text><text for="L10">难道你不觉得？</text><text for="L11">在这世上 在这脑海之中</text><text for="L12">多么美丽 漫天飘舞的花瓣</text><text for="L13">巴拉莱卡酒 真想喝一杯</text><text for="L16">谁人都大抵 疯·狂·至·极</text><text for="L18">任由那一瞬间的感情</text><text for="L19">疾驰不停</text><text for="L21">心跳至九五 狂气的武士</text><text for="L23">以血红的眼引人侧目 随时赴死</text><text for="L24">哈喽 太阳升起</text><text for="L25">你的天空 漆黑如墨的天空</text><text for="L26">狂暴地将它撕裂</text><text for="L27">看啊 就在那个地方</text><text for="L28">传来心跳律动的机关</text><text for="L29">轰鸣奏响的是自己的旋律</text><text for="L30">不属于任何人 是自己的旋律</text><text for="L32">眼前无限展开的世界 一片蔚蓝</text><text for="L33">总而言之</text><text for="L34">来吧 行动起来</text><text for="L35">谈论什么活法 毫无必要</text><text for="L36">何必那样干劲十足 趾高气昂</text><text for="L37">再多给我些 爱</text><text for="L38">左右都分不清 一无所知就别妄言</text><text for="L39">难道你不觉得？</text><text for="L40">咧嘴一笑 暗影在笑</text><text for="L42">世界这东西 大抵</text><text for="L44">疯·狂·至·极</text><text for="L46">仿佛循环往复</text><text for="L47">疾驰不停</text><text for="L49">明明什么都不懂</text><text for="L51">却对这个那个 指手画脚</text><text for="L53">告诉我吧 为那崭新伟大期待时代的圣经</text><text for="L54">狠狠回击</text><text for="L55">迷失心智 击中我自身</text><text for="L56">握紧它 属于你的那个瞬间</text><text for="L57">或许根本没错</text><text for="L60">谁人都大抵 疯·狂·至·极</text><text for="L62">任由那一瞬间的感情</text><text for="L63">疾驰不停</text><text for="L65">心跳至九五 狂气的武士</text><text for="L67">以血红的眼引人侧目 随时赴死</text><text for="L68">哈喽 太阳升起</text><text for="L69">你的天空 漆黑如墨的天空</text><text for="L70">狂暴地将它撕裂</text><text for="L71">看啊 就在那个地方</text><text for="L72">传来心跳律动的机关</text><text for="L73">令人震惊的 还在后头</text><text for="L74">才刚要开始</text><text for="L75">早已等得迫不及待</text><text for="L76">时钟的指针 零时的街道</text><text for="L77">勇猛无畏 来吧 放声高喊</text><text for="L78">看啊 就在不远处</text><text for="L79">即将开启 孤高的盛宴</text><text for="L80">奏响的是自己的旋律</text><text for="L81">独一无二 属于自己的旋律</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>UMETORA</songwriter><songwriter>梅とら</songwriter></songwriters><transliterations><transliteration xml:lang="ja-Latn"><text for="L3"><span begin="24.180" end="24.340" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">brea</span><span begin="24.340" end="24.490" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">k a</span><span begin="24.490" end="24.680" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">way</span> <span begin="24.680" end="24.820" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">brea</span><span begin="24.820" end="24.960" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">k a</span><span begin="24.960" end="25.130" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">way</span> <span begin="25.130" end="25.370" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">sa i</span> <span begin="25.370" end="25.600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">bo u</span> <span begin="25.600" end="25.940" xmlns="http://www.w3.org